#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:3
msgid "CO₂分子の振動は赤外スペクトルにどう現れるか"
msgstr "How Do CO₂ Molecular Vibrations Appear in the Infrared Spectrum?"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:5
msgid ""
"分子に赤外光を当てると、分子固有の振動モードと同じ振動数の光が吸収されます。\\ ただし、すべての振動が光を吸収するわけではありません。\\ "
"振動によって分子の電気双極子モーメントが変化するときだけ、その振動は赤外吸収として観測されます（赤外活性）。"
msgstr ""
"When infrared light strikes a molecule, the molecule absorbs light at "
"frequencies that match its vibrational modes. \\ Some modes, however, do "
"not absorb light. \\ A vibration appears in the infrared absorption "
"spectrum (is IR active) only if it changes the molecule's electric dipole"
" moment."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:9
msgid ""
"一方、分子や固体が熱で振動するときは、複数の振動モードが同時に励起され、それらが重なった運動になります。\\ "
"このページでは、二酸化炭素（CO₂）分子の原子の動きを\\ `第一原理分子動力学 <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/ensembles.html#md-force-evaluation>`__\\ "
"（FPMD）法で計算し、\\ 双極子モーメントの時間変化から、どの振動が赤外スペクトルに現れ、どの振動が現れないかを調べます。\\ "
"外部から電場をかけない計算でも、双極子の自発的な揺らぎを解析すれば、赤外吸収に関係する情報を取り出せるはずです。"
msgstr ""
"By contrast, when molecules or solids vibrate thermally, multiple "
"vibrational modes are excited at once and their motions overlap. \\ Here "
"we use \\ `first-principles molecular dynamics <https://technical-"
"notes.quemix.com/md/ensembles.html#md-force-evaluation>`__\\  (FPMD) to "
"calculate the motion of the atoms in a carbon dioxide (CO₂) molecule \\ "
"and examine how its dipole moment changes over time to identify which "
"vibrations appear in the infrared spectrum and which do not. \\ Even "
"without applying an external electric field, we should be able to extract"
" information about infrared absorption from the spontaneous fluctuations "
"of the dipole moment."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:19
msgid "計算対象と計算条件"
msgstr "Systems and Calculation Conditions"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:21
msgid ""
"計算するのは、1辺10.6 Åの立方体セルの中央に置いた1個のCO₂分子です。\\ 分子軸を :math:`z` 軸に合わせて置きます。\\ "
"セルは周期境界条件で繰り返されますが、隣のセルの分子とは8 Å以上離れているので、ほぼ孤立した分子とみなせます。"
msgstr ""
"We placed one CO₂ molecule at the center of a cubic cell 10.6 Å on a "
"side. \\ The molecular axis lies along the :math:`z` axis. \\ The cell "
"repeats under periodic boundary conditions, but molecules in neighboring "
"cells are at least 8 Å away, so we can treat the molecule as nearly "
"isolated."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:25
msgid "計算は次の2段階で行いました。"
msgstr "We performed the calculations in two stages."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:27
msgid "構造最適化で、エネルギーが最小になるC–O結合長を求めます。結果は1.1645 Åでした（実験値は1.162 Å [7]_ ）。"
msgstr ""
"We used geometry optimization to find the C–O bond length that minimizes "
"the energy. The result was 1.1645 Å (the experimental value is 1.162 Å "
"[7]_)."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:28
msgid ""
"最適化した構造から、各原子に温度10 Kに相当するランダムな初速度を与え、Born–Oppenheimer MD（BOMD）法、および "
"Car–Parrinello MD（CPMD）法 [2]_ で0.8 ps（800 "
"fs）の時間発展を計算します。熱浴は使わず、全エネルギーを一定に保つNVE条件です。"
msgstr ""
"Starting from the optimized structure, we assigned each atom a random "
"initial velocity corresponding to 10 K and computed the time evolution "
"over 0.8 ps (800 fs) using Born–Oppenheimer MD (BOMD) and Car–Parrinello "
"MD (CPMD) [2]_. Both runs used NVE conditions to keep the total energy "
"constant without a heat bath."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:30
msgid ""
"BOMD では、原子を動かすたびに電子状態を収束するまで計算し直します。時間刻みを比較的大きく取れて、今回の計算では 0.5 fs "
"に設定しています。\\ CPMD では、電子の波動関数にも仮想的な質量を与え、原子と一緒に運動方程式で時間発展させます。\\ "
"各ステップで電子状態を収束させる必要がない代わりに、時間刻みを小さくする必要があります。\\ 今回の条件では、時間刻み0.1 "
"fsでは計算が発散したため、0.05 fsとしました。"
msgstr ""
"BOMD recomputes the electronic state to convergence after each update of "
"the atomic positions. It allows a relatively large time step, which we "
"set to 0.5 fs. \\ In CPMD, a fictitious mass is assigned to the "
"electronic wavefunctions as well, and the equations of motion evolve them"
" together with the atoms. \\ CPMD avoids having to converge the "
"electronic state at each step, but it requires a smaller time step. \\ "
"Under these conditions, the calculation diverged with a time step of 0.1 "
"fs, so we used 0.05 fs."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:35
msgid ""
"その他の条件は、RSDFTとQuloudの既定値に合わせました。\\ 今回の計算条件を :numref:`tab-co2-conditions` "
"にまとめておきます。"
msgstr ""
"The other settings follow the RSDFT and Quloud defaults. \\ The "
"calculation conditions are listed in :numref:`tab-co2-conditions`."

