#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:64
#, python-brace-format
msgid "MDの各ステップでは、原子核（価電子分の電荷）と電子密度 :math:`\\rho(\\mathbf{r})` から、分子の双極子モーメント"
msgstr ""
"At each MD step, we use the nuclear charges (the charge corresponding to "
"the valence electrons) and electron density :math:`\\rho(\\mathbf{r})` to"
" calculate the molecular dipole moment"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:66
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{\\mu}(t) = \\sum_I Z_I \\mathbf{R}_I(t) - \\int "
"\\mathbf{r}\\,\\rho(\\mathbf{r},t)\\,d\\mathbf{r}"
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{\\mu}(t) = \\sum_I Z_I \\mathbf{R}_I(t) - \\int "
"\\mathbf{r}\\,\\rho(\\mathbf{r},t)\\,d\\mathbf{r}"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:71
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"を計算して記録します。\\ 電子密度は原子の動きに応じて変わるので、 :math:`\\boldsymbol{\\mu}(t)` "
"には電子状態の変化も反映されます。"
msgstr ""
"and record it. \\ As the electron density changes with atomic motion, "
":math:`\\boldsymbol{\\mu}(t)` also reflects changes in the electronic "
"state."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":eq:`dipole-moment` "
"式は、分子の電子密度がセルの境界に届く前に十分に減衰していること、つまり電子密度がセルの外にはみ出さないことを前提にしています。\\ "
"この前提が成り立てば、中性の分子の双極子は、位置 :math:`\\mathbf{r}` の原点の選び方によりません。\\ "
"一方、固体や液体のように電子密度がセル全体に広がった周期系では、この積分の値がセルの区切り方によって変わってしまい、双極子（分極）をこの式で定義できません。\\"
" そのような系では、ベリー位相を使った分極の理論 [9]_ [10]_ などにもとづく方法が必要です。"
msgstr ""
"Equation :eq:`dipole-moment` assumes that the molecular electron density "
"decays sufficiently before it reaches the cell boundary, so the electron "
"density does not extend outside the cell. \\ Under this assumption, the "
"dipole moment of a neutral molecule is independent of the choice of "
"origin for :math:`\\mathbf{r}`. \\ In periodic systems such as solids and"
" liquids, however, the electron density extends across the entire cell. "
"The integral then depends on where the cell boundary is drawn, so this "
"equation cannot define the dipole moment (polarization). \\ Such systems "
"require methods based, for example, on the Berry-phase theory of "
"polarization [9]_ [10]_."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:84
msgid "振動モードからの予想"
msgstr "Predictions from Vibrational Modes"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:86
msgid ""
"3原子の直線分子には、 :math:`3\\times 3-5=4` 個の基準振動があります（\\ :numref:`fig-"
"co2-modes`\\ ）。"
msgstr ""
"A linear three-atom molecule has :math:`3\\times 3-5=4` normal modes (\\ "
":numref:`fig-co2-modes`\\ )."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:92
msgid ""
"CO₂の基準振動の模式図。矢印の長さは実際の振幅の比を表していません。変角振動ν₂は、分子軸に垂直な2方向（ :math:`x` と "
":math:`y` ）に1つずつあり、振動数が等しい（二重に縮退している）ので、まとめて1つの図にしています。"
msgstr ""
"Schematic of the normal modes of CO₂. The arrow lengths do not show the "
"actual amplitude ratios. There is one bending mode ν₂ in each of the two "
"directions perpendicular to the molecular axis (:math:`x` and :math:`y`)."
" The two have the same frequency (they are doubly degenerate), so one "
"panel represents both."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:94
msgid "**対称伸縮振動ν₁**：2つの酸素原子が炭素原子に対して逆向きに動きます。分子の対称性が保たれるので、双極子モーメントは生じません。赤外不活性です。"
msgstr ""
"In the **symmetric stretching mode ν₁**, the two oxygen atoms move in "
"opposite directions relative to the carbon atom. The molecular symmetry "
"is preserved, so no dipole moment develops. This mode is IR inactive."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:95
msgid ""
"**変角振動ν₂**：分子が折れ曲がる振動で、分子軸に垂直な方向に双極子が生じます。 :math:`z` 軸に沿った分子なら、 "
":math:`\\mu_x` と :math:`\\mu_y` に現れるはずです。"
msgstr ""
"In the **bending mode ν₂**, the molecule bends and develops a dipole "
"moment perpendicular to the molecular axis. For a molecule aligned with "
"the :math:`z` axis, this mode should appear in :math:`\\mu_x` and "
":math:`\\mu_y`."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:96
msgid "**逆対称伸縮振動ν₃**：一方のC–O結合が伸びるとき、もう一方が縮みます。分子軸方向の双極子 :math:`\\mu_z` に現れるはずです。"
msgstr ""
"In the **antisymmetric stretching mode ν₃**, one C–O bond lengthens as "
"the other shortens. This mode should appear in the dipole moment "
":math:`\\mu_z` along the molecular axis."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:98
msgid ""
"比較の目安として、同じ条件で原子を各モードに沿って少しずつ動かした静的な計算からエネルギーの曲率を求め、調和振動数を見積もりました（\\ "
":numref:`tab-co2-harmonic`\\ ）。\\ 原子の変位 :math:`u` に対する全エネルギーを、 :math:`u` "
"の4次までの多項式と、変位の小さい点だけを使った2次式の2通りでフィットしています。\\ 2つの値の差は、フィットに使う変位の範囲による違いです。"
msgstr ""
"For an approximate reference, we estimated harmonic frequencies from the "
"curvature of the energy in static calculations under the same conditions,"
" displacing the atoms in small increments along each mode (\\ :numref"
":`tab-co2-harmonic`\\ ). \\ We fitted the total energy as a function of "
"atomic displacement :math:`u` in two ways, using a polynomial in "
":math:`u` up to fourth order and a quadratic fit using only the points "
"with small displacements. \\ The two estimates differ because the fits "
"cover different displacement ranges."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:102
msgid "静的な計算から求めた調和振動数（cm⁻¹）"
msgstr "Harmonic frequencies from static calculations (cm⁻¹)"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:107 ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:225
#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:326
msgid "モード"
msgstr "Mode"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:108
msgid "4次までのフィット（ :math:`|u|\\le` 0.06 bohr）"
msgstr "Fit up to fourth order (:math:`|u|\\le` 0.06 bohr)"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:109
msgid "2次式のフィット（ :math:`|u|\\le` 0.02 bohr）"
msgstr "Quadratic fit (:math:`|u|\\le` 0.02 bohr)"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:110 ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:231
#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:344
msgid "ν₁ 対称伸縮"
msgstr "ν₁ Symmetric stretching"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:111 ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:112
#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:234
msgid "1311"
msgstr "1311"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:113 ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:237
#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:338
msgid "ν₂ 変角"
msgstr "ν₂ Bending"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:114 ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:240
msgid "637"
msgstr "637"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:115
msgid "644"
msgstr "644"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:116 ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:243
#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:332
msgid "ν₃ 逆対称伸縮"
msgstr "ν₃ Antisymmetric stretching"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:117 ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:246
msgid "2330"
msgstr "2330"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:118
msgid "2337"
msgstr "2337"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:120
msgid ""
":math:`u` は酸素原子の変位で、重心が動かないように炭素原子も動かしています。\\ 変角振動とν₃では、 :math:`u` "
"の正負でエネルギーが等しいので、正の変位だけを計算しています。"
msgstr ""
":math:`u` is the displacement of the oxygen atoms. We also moved the "
"carbon atom to keep the center of mass fixed. \\ For the bending mode and"
" ν₃, the energy is the same for positive and negative :math:`u`, so we "
"calculated only positive displacements."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:125
msgid ""
"実空間の格子を使う計算では、原子と格子点の相対的な位置によって、全エネルギーがわずかに変わります（egg-box効果）。\\ "
"今回の条件で、分子の形を変えずに :math:`x` 方向へ格子間隔1つ分（0.313 bohr）平行移動させると、全エネルギーは最大91 "
"μHa（温度に換算して約29 K）変化しました。\\ これは、変角振動で :math:`u` = 0.01 "
"bohr動かしたときのエネルギー変化（97 μHa）と同程度です。\\ そのため、柔らかい振動の調和振動数は、変位の選び方に敏感です。\\ "
":math:`u` = 0.0025〜0.01 bohrの1点ずつから求めると、変角振動ν₂は615〜661 "
"cm⁻¹、対称伸縮振動ν₁は1194〜1298 cm⁻¹とばらつきます。\\ 逆対称伸縮振動ν₃は、同じ範囲でも2327〜2338 "
"cm⁻¹と安定しています。\\ :numref:`tab-co2-harmonic` のν₁とν₂の値には、数 "
"%の不確かさがあると考えてください。"
msgstr ""
"In calculations on a real-space grid, the total energy varies slightly "
"with the position of the atoms relative to the grid points (the egg-box "
"effect). \\ Under these conditions, translating the molecule by one grid "
"spacing (0.313 bohr) in the :math:`x` direction without changing its "
"shape changed the total energy by up to 91 μHa (equivalent to about 29 "
"K). \\ This is comparable to the energy change for a displacement of "
":math:`u` = 0.01 bohr along the bending mode (97 μHa). \\ The harmonic "
"frequencies of soft modes are therefore sensitive to the choice of "
"displacement. \\ :math:`u` = 0.0025–0.01 bohr gives frequencies of "
"615–661 cm⁻¹ for the bending mode ν₂ and 1194–1298 cm⁻¹ for the symmetric"
" stretching mode ν₁ when each displacement is used on its own. \\ The "
"antisymmetric stretching mode ν₃ is more stable over the same range, at "
"2327–2338 cm⁻¹. \\ :numref:`tab-co2-harmonic` lists the ν₁ and ν₂ values,"
" which should be read with an uncertainty of a few percent."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:133
msgid ""
"予想をまとめると、MDの双極子からは「 :math:`x,y` 成分に約640 cm⁻¹、 :math:`z` 成分に約2300 "
"cm⁻¹の振動が現れ、約1300 cm⁻¹の対称伸縮振動は現れない」はずです。"
msgstr ""
"In summary, the dipole moment in MD should show vibrations near 640 cm⁻¹ "
"in the :math:`x,y` components and near 2300 cm⁻¹ in the :math:`z` "
"component. We expect no signal from the symmetric stretching mode near "
"1300 cm⁻¹."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:136
msgid "双極子モーメントの時間変化"
msgstr "Time Evolution of the Dipole Moment"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:138
msgid ""
"CPMD および BOMD で得た :eq:`dipole-moment` 式の双極子モーメントの時間変化を :numref:`fig-"
"co2-dipole` に示します。"
msgstr ""
":numref:`fig-co2-dipole` shows the time evolution of the dipole moment "
"from Equation :eq:`dipole-moment` for CPMD and BOMD."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:144
msgid ""
"双極子モーメントの各成分の、計算全体の平均値からのずれ "
":math:`\\delta\\mu_\\alpha(t)=\\mu_\\alpha(t)-\\langle\\mu_\\alpha\\rangle`。青はCPMD、橙はBOMDで、初期構造と初速度は同じです。左は計算全体、右は最初の100"
" fsの拡大です。縦軸は原子単位（1 a.u. = 2.54 D）で、成分ごとに範囲が異なります。"
msgstr ""
"Deviation of each dipole moment component from its mean over the full "
"run, "
":math:`\\delta\\mu_\\alpha(t)=\\mu_\\alpha(t)-\\langle\\mu_\\alpha\\rangle`."
" Blue denotes CPMD and orange denotes BOMD, both with the same initial "
"structure and velocities. The left panels show the full run, and the "
"right panels zoom in on the first 100 fs. The vertical axes use atomic "
"units (1 a.u. = 2.54 D), with different ranges for each component."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:146
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`x` と :math:`y` 成分は周期約52 fsのゆっくりした振動、 :math:`z` 成分は周期約15 "
"fsの速い振動を示しています。\\ 波数に直すと、それぞれ約640 cm⁻¹と約2200 cm⁻¹です。\\ "
"予想どおり、前者が変角振動、後者が逆対称伸縮振動に対応すると考えられます。\\ "
"BOMDの振動はCPMDより少し速く、2つの曲線の位相は時間とともにずれていきます。\\ これらの違いは :numref:`{number}節 "
"<sec-co2-exp>` で調べます。"
msgstr ""
"The :math:`x` and :math:`y` components oscillate slowly with a period of "
"about 52 fs, and the :math:`z` component oscillates quickly with a period"
" of about 15 fs. \\ These periods correspond to wavenumbers of about 640 "
"cm⁻¹ and 2200 cm⁻¹, respectively. \\ As predicted, the former appears to "
"correspond to bending and the latter to antisymmetric stretching. \\ The "
"oscillations are slightly faster in BOMD than in CPMD, and the two curves"
" drift out of phase over time. \\ We examine these differences in "
":numref:`Section {number} <sec-co2-exp>`."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:152
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
":math:`x` 成分と :math:`y` 成分では振幅が約4倍違いますが、これは分子の性質ではありません。\\ "
"ランダムに与えた初速度によって、 :math:`x` 方向と :math:`y` 方向の変角振動に異なるエネルギーが入ったためです（\\ "
":numref:`{number}節 <sec-co2-intensity>`\\ ）。"
msgstr ""
"The :math:`x` and :math:`y` amplitudes differ by a factor of about 4, but"
" this difference is not a property of the molecule. \\ The random initial"
" velocities put different amounts of energy into bending along :math:`x` "
"and :math:`y` (\\ :numref:`Section {number} <sec-co2-intensity>`\\ )."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:158
msgid "自己相関関数"
msgstr "Autocorrelation Function"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:160
msgid "双極子の時間変化から振動数成分を取り出すため、各成分の自己相関関数のフーリエ変換（パワースペクトル）を計算します。"
msgstr ""
"To extract the frequency components of the time-varying dipole moment, we"
" compute the Fourier transform of the autocorrelation function of each "
"component (the power spectrum)."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:162
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"C_\\alpha(\\omega) = \\int_{-T}^{T} w(\\tau)\\,\n"
"\\left\\langle "
"\\delta\\mu_\\alpha(t+\\tau)\\,\\delta\\mu_\\alpha(t)\\right\\rangle_t "
"\\cos(\\omega\\tau)\\,d\\tau"
msgstr ""
"C_\\alpha(\\omega) = \\int_{-T}^{T} w(\\tau)\\,\n"
"\\left\\langle "
"\\delta\\mu_\\alpha(t+\\tau)\\,\\delta\\mu_\\alpha(t)\\right\\rangle_t "
"\\cos(\\omega\\tau)\\,d\\tau"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:168
msgid ""
"ここで :math:`\\langle\\cdots\\rangle_t` は時刻 :math:`t` についての平均、 :math:`T` = "
"800 fsは計算時間、 :math:`w(\\tau)` "
"は有限の計算時間で打ち切ったことによる振動（漏れ）を抑える窓関数（Hann窓）です。\\ 計算時間が有限なので、波数の分解能はおよそ "
":math:`1/(cT)\\approx` 42 cm⁻¹です。"
msgstr ""
"Here :math:`\\langle\\cdots\\rangle_t` denotes an average over time "
":math:`t`, :math:`T` = 800 fs is the duration of the calculation, and "
":math:`w(\\tau)` is a window function (Hann window) that suppresses "
"oscillations (spectral leakage) caused by truncating the time series. \\ "
"The finite duration gives an approximate wavenumber resolution of "
":math:`1/(cT)\\approx` 42 cm⁻¹."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:171
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"平衡状態の古典系では、揺動散逸定理により、赤外吸収係数は :math:`\\omega^2 C(\\omega)` に比例します [6]_ 。\\"
" 今回のような鋭いピークでは、 :math:`\\omega^2` を掛けてもピークの位置はほとんど変わらないので、ここではまず "
":math:`C(\\omega)` でピークの位置を調べます。\\ ピークの高さについては、 :numref:`{number}節 <sec-"
"co2-intensity>` で考えます。"
msgstr ""
"For a classical system at equilibrium, the fluctuation–dissipation "
"theorem states that the infrared absorption coefficient is proportional "
"to :math:`\\omega^2 C(\\omega)` [6]_. \\ For sharp peaks like these, "
"multiplication by :math:`\\omega^2` hardly shifts the peak positions, so "
"we first locate the peaks in :math:`C(\\omega)`. \\ We discuss peak "
"heights in :numref:`Section {number} <sec-co2-intensity>`."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:175
msgid ""
"比較のため、振動座標の時間発展についても、同じようにパワースペクトルを計算しました。\\ "
"対称伸縮は2つのC–O結合長の平均、逆対称伸縮は2つの結合長の差の半分、変角は2つの酸素原子の中点から炭素原子までの変位の :math:`x` 、"
" :math:`y` 成分です。"
msgstr ""
"For comparison, we also computed power spectra of the time series of the "
"vibrational coordinates in the same way. \\ The symmetric stretching "
"coordinate is the mean of the two C–O lengths, the antisymmetric "
"stretching coordinate is half their difference, and the bending "
"coordinates are the :math:`x` and :math:`y` components of the "
"displacement from the midpoint of the two oxygen atoms to the carbon "
"atom."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:182
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"CPMDの結果。左：双極子モーメントの各成分のパワースペクトル :math:`C_\\alpha(\\omega)` （式 "
":eq:`co2-power` ）。右：原子の座標から求めた振動座標のパワースペクトル。右の図は、300〜4000 "
"cm⁻¹での最大値が1になるように、曲線ごとに規格化しています。そのため、曲線の高さからモードの間の振動の大きさは比べられません（\\ "
":numref:`{number}節 <sec-co2-shifted-start>`\\ "
"）。縦軸はどちらも対数です。縦の点線は、静的な計算から求めた調和振動数（ :numref:`tab-co2-harmonic` "
"の4次までのフィットの値。左からν₂、ν₁、ν₃）です。"
msgstr ""
"CPMD results. On the left are the power spectra "
":math:`C_\\alpha(\\omega)` of the dipole moment components (Equation "
":eq:`co2-power`). On the right are the power spectra of the vibrational "
"coordinates derived from the atomic positions. Each curve on the right is"
" normalized to a maximum of 1 over 300–4000 cm⁻¹. The curve heights "
"therefore cannot be used to compare the amplitudes of different modes (\\"
" :numref:`Section {number} <sec-co2-shifted-start>`\\ ). Both vertical "
"axes are logarithmic. The dotted vertical lines mark the harmonic "
"frequencies from the static calculations (the fits up to fourth order in "
":numref:`tab-co2-harmonic`, ordered ν₂, ν₁, and ν₃ from left to right)."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:188
msgid "BOMDの結果。図の作り方と軸の意味は :numref:`fig-co2-spectra` と同じです。"
msgstr ""
"BOMD results. The spectra are plotted as in :numref:`fig-co2-spectra` and"
" the axes have the same meanings."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:190
msgid ":numref:`fig-co2-spectra` と :numref:`fig-co2-spectra-bomd` から、次のことが読み取れます。"
msgstr ""
"The spectra in :numref:`fig-co2-spectra` and :numref:`fig-co2-spectra-"
"bomd` show the following features."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:192
msgid ""
"双極子の :math:`x` 、 :math:`y` 成分には640–670 cm⁻¹付近、 :math:`z` 成分には2200–2300 "
"cm⁻¹付近にピークがあります。右の図で同じ位置にピークを持つのは、変角振動と逆対称伸縮振動です。"
msgstr ""
"The :math:`x` and :math:`y` components of the dipole moment have peaks "
"near 640–670 cm⁻¹, and the :math:`z` component has a peak near 2200–2300 "
"cm⁻¹. In the right-hand panels, the bending and antisymmetric stretching "
"modes have peaks at the same positions."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:193
msgid ""
"双極子には、1200–1300 cm⁻¹付近にピークは見当たりません。 :math:`z` "
"成分の裾がこの付近にかかっていますが、値は主ピークの1万分の1以下です。"
msgstr ""
"The dipole moment has no peak near 1200–1300 cm⁻¹. The tail of the "
":math:`z` component extends into this range, but its value there is at "
"most one ten-thousandth of the main peak height."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:194
msgid ""
"ところが、右の図を見ると、対称伸縮振動は1200–1300 "
"cm⁻¹付近にピークを持ちます。このピークは、原子が確かにこの振動数で振動していることを示しています。"
msgstr ""
"The right-hand panels, however, show a symmetric stretching peak near "
"1200–1300 cm⁻¹. This peak confirms that the atoms vibrate at this "
"frequency."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:196
msgid ""
"つまり、\\ **対称伸縮振動は、原子が振動していても双極子には現れない**\\ "
"、すなわち赤外不活性であることが、MD計算の結果から直接確かめられました。"
msgstr ""
"The MD results thus directly confirm that \\ **the symmetric stretching "
"mode leaves no signal in the dipole moment even when the atoms vibrate** "
"\\ and is therefore IR inactive."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:198
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ただし、この計算では対称伸縮振動の振幅が0.5 mÅ以下と小さく、右の図では低波数側にゆっくりした変化の成分も見えています。\\ "
"対称伸縮振動を大きく励起した場合は :numref:`{number}節 <sec-co2-shifted-start>` で調べます。"
msgstr ""
"In this calculation, however, the symmetric stretching amplitude is small"
" (0.5 mÅ or less), and slowly varying components are also visible at low "
"wavenumbers in the right-hand panels. \\ We examine what happens when the"
" symmetric stretching mode is strongly excited in :numref:`Section "
"{number} <sec-co2-shifted-start>`."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:201
msgid ""
"なお、CPMD の双極子スペクトルの :math:`x` 成分にも2195 cm⁻¹にピークが見られます（\\ :math:`z` "
"成分の約200分の1）。\\ これは、計算の間に分子軸が :math:`z` 軸から最大13°傾くため、逆対称伸縮振動による双極子の一部が "
":math:`x` 成分に混ざったものです。\\ 分子の向きは、初速度に含まれる回転の成分によって変わります。\\ "
"ただし、この計算では分子の角運動量も一定に保たれていませんでした。\\ 原子と格子の相対位置によってエネルギーが変わる効果（\\ :numref"
":`tab-co2-harmonic` の後の注）は、温度に換算して約29 Kと、10 "
"Kの運動エネルギーより大きいので、これが分子の向きに影響している可能性があります。\\ "
"同じ初速度から始めたBOMDでは、分子軸の傾きは最大1.2°にとどまり、 :math:`x` 成分の2200 "
"cm⁻¹付近のピークもほとんど見えません。\\ 傾きの原因は、ここでは詳しく調べていません。"
msgstr ""
"The :math:`x` component of the CPMD dipole spectrum also has a peak at "
"2195 cm⁻¹ (about 1/200 of the height of the peak in the \\ :math:`z` "
"component). \\ During the calculation, the molecular axis tilts by up to "
"13° from the :math:`z` axis, so part of the dipole moment from "
"antisymmetric stretching projects onto the :math:`x` component. \\ The "
"rotational component of the initial velocities changes the orientation of"
" the molecule. \\ In this calculation, however, the molecule's angular "
"momentum was also not conserved. \\ The energy variation with the "
"position of the atoms relative to the real-space grid (see the note after"
" \\ :numref:`tab-co2-harmonic`) corresponds to about 29 K, which is "
"larger than the kinetic energy corresponding to 10 K. The grid effect may"
" therefore influence the molecular orientation. \\ With the same initial "
"velocities, the molecular axis in BOMD tilted by at most 1.2°, and the "
"peak near 2200 cm⁻¹ in the :math:`x` component is barely visible. \\ We "
"did not examine the cause of the tilt in detail."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:212
msgid "各計算手法および実験との比較"
msgstr "Comparison Across Calculation Methods and with Experiment"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:214
msgid ""
":numref:`fig-co2-spectra` と :numref:`fig-co2-spectra-bomd` "
"のピーク位置から読み取ったCPMDとBOMDの振動数を、\\ :numref:`tab-co2-harmonic` "
"の静的計算による調和振動数、および実験値と比べます（\\ :numref:`tab-co2-freq`\\ ）。"
msgstr ""
"We compare the CPMD and BOMD frequencies read from the peaks in :numref"
":`fig-co2-spectra` and :numref:`fig-co2-spectra-bomd` with the harmonic "
"frequencies from the static calculations in \\ :numref:`tab-co2-harmonic`"
" and with the experimental values (\\ :numref:`tab-co2-freq`\\ )."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:216
msgid ""
"BOMDでも、双極子にはν₂とν₃のピークだけが現れ、ν₁は振動座標のスペクトルにだけ現れます。\\ どのピークも CPMD（\\ :numref"
":`fig-co2-spectra`\\ ） より高い波数にずれています。\\ 対称伸縮のスペクトルは、CPMD "
"で見えていた低波数側のゆっくりした変化の成分が、BOMD ではほとんどなく、1309 cm⁻¹のピークがはっきりしています。"
msgstr ""
"In BOMD too, the dipole spectrum shows only ν₂ and ν₃, whereas ν₁ appears"
" only in the spectra of the vibrational coordinates. \\ All the BOMD "
"peaks lie at higher wavenumbers than their CPMD counterparts (\\ :numref"
":`fig-co2-spectra`\\ ). \\ In the symmetric stretching spectrum, the "
"slowly varying low-wavenumber contribution visible in CPMD is almost "
"absent in BOMD, and the peak at 1309 cm⁻¹ is clear."

