"starting at 1.150 Å (:numref:`Section {number} <sec-co2-shifted-start>`),"
" the intensities remain nearly the same (CPMD gives 633 km/mol for ν₃ and"
" 22 km/mol × 2 for ν₂, and BOMD gives 553 km/mol for ν₃ and 22 km/mol × 2"
" for ν₂)."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:354
msgid ""
"CPMDとBOMDを比べると、変角振動の :math:`\\partial\\mu/\\partial Q` "
"は一致しますが、ν₃ではCPMDの変化率の絶対値が7 %大きく、赤外強度は14 %大きくなっています。\\ "
"CPMDで電子が原子の動きに遅れてついていくことが、双極子の応答にも影響していると考えられますが、ここでは詳しく調べていません。\\ "
"BOMDの赤外強度は、ν₃、ν₂とも実験値より小さめですが、ν₃とν₂の強度の比（約13）は実験（約12）に近い値です。\\ "
"赤外吸収の強さを議論するなら、 :math:`C_\\alpha(\\omega)` "
"のピークの高さではなく、この方法で求めた値を使うのが適切です。"
msgstr ""
"CPMD and BOMD agree on :math:`\\partial\\mu/\\partial Q` for the bending "
"mode, but for ν₃ the magnitude of the derivative is 7 % greater in CPMD, "
"and the IR intensity is 14 % greater. \\ The lag of the electrons behind "
"the motion of the atoms in CPMD may also affect the dipole response, "
"although we did not examine this in detail. \\ Both BOMD intensities, for"
" ν₃ and ν₂, are somewhat lower than the experimental values, but their "
"ratio (about 13) is close to the experimental ratio (about 12). \\ The "
"values obtained by this method are appropriate for discussing infrared "
"absorption strength, whereas the peak heights of "
":math:`C_\\alpha(\\omega)` are unsuitable."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:362
msgid "構造をずらして始めると"
msgstr "Starting from a Displaced Structure"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:364
msgid ""
"ここまでの計算では、最適化した構造から計算を始めたので、対称伸縮振動はほとんど励起されていませんでした。\\ :numref:`fig-"
"co2-spectra` と :numref:`fig-co2-spectra-bomd` "
"の右の図では、曲線ごとに規格化しているので他のモードと同じ高さに見えますが、対称伸縮の振幅は0.001 Å程度以下です。\\ "
"基準座標の運動エネルギーを温度に換算すると、対称伸縮はCPMDで0.2 K、BOMDで0.6 Kで、逆対称伸縮（10〜14 K）や "
":math:`x` 方向の変角（6〜7 K）の数十分の一しかありません。\\ そこで、両方のC–O結合を1.150 "
"Åに縮めた構造から、同じ条件でCPMDとBOMDを計算しました。\\ 平衡長より0.0145 "
"Å短いので、計算開始とともに対称伸縮振動が大きく振動し始めます（\\ :numref:`fig-co2-energy-flow` の上）。\\ "
"初速度は前の計算と同じで、解放されたエネルギーのため、平均温度は、最適化構造から始めた計算の約4 Kから、CPMDで43 K、BOMDで49 "
"Kに上がりました。"
msgstr ""
"In the calculations so far, the symmetric stretching mode was barely "
"excited because we started from the optimized structure. \\ :numref:`fig-"
"co2-spectra` and :numref:`fig-co2-spectra-bomd` make its peak look as "
"high as those of the other modes because the curves in the right-hand "
"panels are normalized separately, but the symmetric stretching amplitude "
"is only about 0.001 Å or less. \\ Converting the kinetic energy of each "
"normal coordinate to a temperature gives 0.2 K for symmetric stretching "
"in CPMD and 0.6 K in BOMD, tens of times smaller than the values for "
"antisymmetric stretching (10–14 K) and bending along :math:`x` (6–7 K). "
"\\ We therefore ran CPMD and BOMD under the same conditions starting from"
" a structure with both C–O bonds shortened to 1.150 Å. \\ Because the "
"bonds are 0.0145 Å shorter than at equilibrium, the symmetric stretching "
"mode begins to oscillate with a large amplitude as soon as the "
"calculation starts (top panel of \\ :numref:`fig-co2-energy-flow`). \\ We"
" used the same initial velocities as before. The energy released raised "
"the average temperature from about 4 K in the runs starting from the "
"optimized structure to 43 K in CPMD and 49 K in BOMD."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:375
msgid ""
"上：2つのC–O結合長の平均。下：2つの酸素原子を結ぶ直線からの炭素原子のずれの大きさ（ :math:`x` 、 :math:`y` "
"成分を合わせたもの）。青は最適化構造から始めたCPMD、橙と緑はC–O 1.150 Åから始めたCPMDとBOMDです。"
msgstr ""
"The top panel shows the mean of the two C–O bond lengths. The bottom "
"panel shows how far the carbon atom lies from the line joining the two "
"oxygen atoms (combining the :math:`x` and :math:`y` components). Blue "
"denotes CPMD starting from the optimized structure. Orange and green "
"denote CPMD and BOMD, respectively, starting at a C–O bond length of "
"1.150 Å."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:378
msgid "差音と結合音"
msgstr "Difference Bands and Combination Bands"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:380
msgid ""
"これらの計算の双極子の :math:`z` 成分のスペクトルを、最適化構造から始めた計算と比べたのが :numref:`fig-"
"co2-sidebands` です。"
msgstr ""
"The spectra of the :math:`z` component of the dipole moment in these runs"
" and in the runs starting from the optimized structure are compared in "
":numref:`fig-co2-sidebands`."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:386
msgid ""
"双極子の :math:`z` 成分のパワースペクトル（縦軸は対数）。上はCPMD、下はBOMDです。青は最適化構造（C–O 1.1645 "
"Å）から、橙はC–O 1.150 Åから始めた計算です。"
msgstr ""
"Power spectra of the :math:`z` component of the dipole moment "
"(logarithmic vertical axis). The top panel shows CPMD and the bottom "
"panel BOMD. Blue denotes runs starting from the optimized structure (C–O "
"1.1645 Å) and orange denotes runs starting at C–O 1.150 Å."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:388
msgid ""
"CPMDでは、主ピーク（2185 cm⁻¹）の両側の985 cm⁻¹と3410 cm⁻¹に、新しく弱いピークが現れました。\\ "
"この計算での対称伸縮振動の振動数は1218 cm⁻¹なので、ν₃−ν₁ = 967 cm⁻¹とν₃+ν₁ = 3403 "
"cm⁻¹に、分解能の範囲で一致します。\\ それぞれ差音、結合音と呼ばれるものです。\\ BOMDでも、主ピーク（2339 "
"cm⁻¹）の両側の1022 cm⁻¹と3656 cm⁻¹に弱いピークが現れ、BOMDのν₁（1319 cm⁻¹）から求めたν₃−ν₁ = 1020"
" cm⁻¹、ν₃+ν₁ = 3658 cm⁻¹と一致します。\\ "
"ピークの位置は、CPMDによる振動数の低下の分だけずれていますが、現象は同じです。\\ "
"一方、ν₁の振動数そのものには、対称伸縮の振幅を30倍にしても、どちらの計算でも双極子のピークが現れません。"
msgstr ""
"In CPMD, new weak peaks appeared at 985 cm⁻¹ and 3410 cm⁻¹ on either side"
" of the main peak (2185 cm⁻¹). \\ The symmetric stretching frequency in "
"this run is 1218 cm⁻¹, so within the resolution the peaks agree with "
"ν₃−ν₁ = 967 cm⁻¹ and ν₃+ν₁ = 3403 cm⁻¹. \\ These are known as the "
"difference band and combination band, respectively. \\ BOMD also shows "
"weak peaks at 1022 cm⁻¹ and 3656 cm⁻¹ on either side of the main peak "
"(2339 cm⁻¹). They agree with ν₃−ν₁ = 1020 cm⁻¹ and ν₃+ν₁ = 3658 cm⁻¹, "
"calculated using the BOMD ν₁ of 1319 cm⁻¹. \\ The lower CPMD frequencies "
"shift the peak positions, but the phenomenon is the same. \\ In contrast,"
" at the frequency of ν₁ itself, neither calculation shows a peak in the "
"dipole moment, even with the symmetric stretching amplitude increased by "
"a factor of 30."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:395
msgid ""
"ピークの高さは、CPMDでは主ピークの約700分の1、BOMDでは約360分の1（差音）と約500分の1（結合音）です。\\ "
"和と差の振動数が生じる仕組みは2つ考えられます。"
msgstr ""
"The peaks are about 1/700 as high as the main peak in CPMD and about "
"1/360 (difference band) and 1/500 (combination band) in BOMD. \\ Two "
"mechanisms can give rise to the sum and difference frequencies."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:398
msgid ""
"**原子の運動そのものが変調される（力学的な非調和性）。** "
"C–O結合が縮んでいるときと伸びているときでは、逆対称伸縮振動のばね定数が異なります。ポテンシャルに :math:`Q_1 Q_3^2` "
"に比例する項があると、逆対称伸縮の座標 :math:`Q_3` の振動がν₁の周期で変調され、 :math:`Q_3` "
"自身にν₃±ν₁の成分が生じます。"
msgstr ""
"**The atomic motion itself is modulated (mechanical anharmonicity).** The"
" spring constant for the antisymmetric stretching mode differs between "
"shortened and lengthened C–O bonds. If the potential contains a term "
"proportional to :math:`Q_1 Q_3^2`, oscillations of the antisymmetric "
"stretching coordinate :math:`Q_3` are modulated with the period of ν₁, "
"producing ν₃±ν₁ components in :math:`Q_3` itself."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:399
msgid ""
"**双極子の変化率が結合長で変わる（電気的な非調和性）。** 双極子 :math:`\\mu_z` に :math:`Q_1 Q_3` "
"に比例する項があると、 :math:`\\cos\\omega_1 t\\cos\\omega_3 t` から和と差の振動数が生じます。 "
":math:`Q_1` は対称、 :math:`Q_3` は反対称な変位なので、その積は反対称で、 :math:`z` "
"方向の双極子に現れることができます。"
msgstr ""
"**The dipole derivative changes with bond length (electrical "
"anharmonicity).** If the dipole component :math:`\\mu_z` contains a term "
"proportional to :math:`Q_1 Q_3`, then :math:`\\cos\\omega_1 "
"t\\cos\\omega_3 t` gives rise to the sum and difference frequencies. The "
"displacements :math:`Q_1` and :math:`Q_3` are symmetric and "
"antisymmetric, respectively, so their product is antisymmetric and can "
"contribute to the dipole component along :math:`z`."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:401
msgid ""
"どちらが効いているかを調べるため、CPMDの計算で、原子の座標から求めた :math:`Q_3` のスペクトルを見ると、984 cm⁻¹と3411"
" cm⁻¹に、それぞれ主ピークの約440分の1と約1400分の1のピークがありました。\\ "
"原子の運動そのものが変調されている（仕組み1）ことになります。\\ さらに、双極子を :math:`\\mu_z = aQ_3 + bQ_1Q_3"
" + c` で近似して係数をフィットすると、 :math:`bQ_1Q_3` の項（仕組み2）は単独では :math:`aQ_3` "
"の項より小さいものの、 :math:`aQ_3` の側帯波と干渉して、低波数側のピークを弱め、高波数側のピークを強めていました。\\ "
"2つの項を足すと、ピークの高さは主ピークの約580分の1と約900分の1になり、実際の双極子（約690分の1と約750分の1）をおおむね説明できます。\\"
" この近似式では双極子の揺らぎの15 %ほどが説明できずに残るので、この分解は目安です。"
msgstr ""
"To see which mechanism contributes, we examined the CPMD spectrum of "
":math:`Q_3` calculated from the atomic coordinates. We found peaks at 984"
" cm⁻¹ and 3411 cm⁻¹, about 1/440 and 1/1400 as high as the main peak, "
"respectively. \\ This shows that the atomic motion itself is modulated "
"(mechanism 1). \\ We also fitted the coefficients of the approximate "
"dipole expression :math:`\\mu_z = aQ_3 + bQ_1Q_3 + c`. Although the "
":math:`bQ_1Q_3` term (mechanism 2) is smaller on its own than the "
":math:`aQ_3` term, it interferes with the sidebands of :math:`aQ_3`, "
"weakening the lower-wavenumber peak and strengthening the higher-"
"wavenumber peak. \\ Adding the two terms gives peak heights about 1/580 "
"and 1/900 of the main peak height, roughly accounting for the values in "
"the actual dipole spectrum (about 1/690 and 1/750). \\ The approximation "
"leaves about 15 % of the dipole fluctuations unexplained, so this "
"decomposition gives only a rough estimate."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:407
msgid ""
"実際のCO₂でも、ν₃に関係する差音・結合音は観測されています。\\ 例えば、CO₂レーザーが発振する約960 cm⁻¹と約1060 "
"cm⁻¹の光は、ν₃の励起状態から、ν₁と2ν₂が混ざった準位への遷移によるものです。\\ "
"古典的なMDで現れる差音のピークは、量子力学的な準位間の遷移と同じものではありませんが、同じ非調和性に由来する現象です。"
msgstr ""
"Difference bands and combination bands involving ν₃ have also been "
"observed in actual CO₂. \\ For example, CO₂ laser emission at about 960 "
"cm⁻¹ and 1060 cm⁻¹ comes from transitions from an excited ν₃ state to "
"levels in which ν₁ and 2ν₂ are mixed. \\ Although difference-band peaks "
"in classical MD are distinct from quantum-mechanical transitions between "
"levels, both arise from the same anharmonicity."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:412
msgid "対称伸縮から変角へのエネルギーの移動"
msgstr "Energy Transfer from Symmetric Stretching to Bending"

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:414
msgid ""
"これらの計算では、もう一つ興味深いことが起きていました。\\ :numref:`fig-co2-energy-flow` "
"のC–O結合長の平均（対称伸縮）と、炭素原子の分子軸からのずれ（変角）について、100 fsの区間ごとの振幅を :numref:`tab-co2"
"-energy-flow` にまとめます。"
msgstr ""
"These calculations showed another noteworthy feature. \\ :numref:`fig-co2"
"-energy-flow` shows the mean C–O bond length (symmetric stretching) and "
"the displacement of the carbon atom from the molecular axis (bending), "
"and :numref:`tab-co2-energy-flow` summarizes their amplitudes in 100 fs "
"intervals."

#: ../../co2_ir/ir_spectrum.rst:417
msgid "100 fsごとの振幅（1.150 Åから始めた計算、単位は10⁻³ Å）。対称伸縮は結合長平均の振幅、変角は炭素原子のずれの最大値"
msgstr ""
"Amplitudes in 100 fs intervals for the runs starting at 1.150 Å, in units"
" of 10⁻³ Å. For symmetric stretching, the table gives the amplitude of "
"the mean bond length. For bending, it gives the maximum displacement of "
